2654752</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002362-Regoes1"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Regoes</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonhoeffer</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Emergence of drug-resistant influenza virus: population dynamical considerations.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>312</volume><fpage>389</fpage><lpage>391</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16627735</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002362-Lipsitch1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lipsitch</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Levin</surname><given-names>BR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Antiviral resistance and the control of pandemic influenza.</article-title><source>PLoS Med</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>e15</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17253900</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002362-Debarre1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Debarre</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Bonhoeffer</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Regoes</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>The effect of population structure on the emergence of drug resistance during influenza pandemics.</article-title><source>J R Soc Interface</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>893</fpage><lpage>906</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17609176</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002362-Alexander1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Alexander</su